<LegalPage lang="en" title="Privacy">
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>Sebastian Dehn, address and email see <a href="/en/imprint/">imprint</a>.</p>
  <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>
    This site is delivered via Cloudflare (Cloudflare, Inc., USA). When you visit it, Cloudflare processes technically
    necessary data such as IP address, time, requested URL and browser identifier (server logs) to deliver the site and
    protect it against attacks. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR; the legitimate interest is secure and stable
    operation. A data processing agreement with Cloudflare is in place; Cloudflare is certified under the EU-US Data
    Privacy Framework.
  </p>
  <h2>Cookies, tracking, third-party content</h2>
  <p>
    This site sets no cookies, uses no tracking or analytics and loads no third-party content; fonts are served by this
    site itself. Links to LinkedIn and GitHub only connect you to those services when you click them.
  </p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection
    (Art. 15–21 GDPR) and the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority, for example the
    State Commissioner for Data Protection and Freedom of Information of North Rhine-Westphalia.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
